## Command

```shell
biome lint Component.svelte
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "formatter": { "enabled": false },
  "html": {
    "experimentalFullSupportEnabled": true,
    "linter": { "enabled": true }
  },
  "linter": {
    "rules": {
      "preset": "none",
      "suspicious": {
        "noClassAssign": "error",
        "noFunctionAssign": "error",
        "noImportAssign": "error"
      }
    }
  },
  "assist": { "enabled": false }
}
```

## `Component.svelte`

```svelte
<script>
import value from "pkg";
function update() {}
class Widget {}
</script>

<button
    onclick={() => {
        value = 1;
        update = () => {};
        Widget = class {};
    }}
>
    Update
</button>

```

